  solution        : "Unload and disable the freevxfs kernel module. - Run the following commands to unload the freevxfs kernel module: # modprobe -r freevxfs 2>/dev/null # rmmod freevxfs 2>/dev/null - Perform the following to disable the freevxfs kernel module: Create a file ending in .conf with install freevxfs /bin/false in the /etc/modprobe.d/ directory."
  reference       : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-6 CM-7"
  see_also        : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
</report>
      </then>

      <else>
